    "description": {
      "value": "<p><span class=\"GramE\"><strong><em><span style=\"font-family:宋體;mso-bidi-font-family:宋體\">寶石龍</span></em></strong></span><strong><em><span style=\"font-family:宋體;mso-bidi-font-family:宋體\">起源</span></em></strong>。你的血脈可追溯到某隻<span class=\"GramE\">寶石龍</span>身上，這賦予<span class=\"GramE\">你特殊</span>的魔法親和。從<span class=\"GramE\">寶石龍</span>血脈表格中選擇一項，這將決定<span class=\"GramE\">你其他</span>特性的傷害類型。<span>         <br /></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"GramE\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:宋體;mso-bidi-font-family:宋體\">寶石龍</span></strong></span><strong><span style=\"font-family:宋體;mso-bidi-font-family:宋體\">血脈</span></strong><span><br /></span>龍種<span>         </span>傷害類型<span><br /></span>紫水晶<span>      </span>力場<span><br /></span>水晶<span>          </span>光耀<span><br /></span>翡翠<span>          </span>心靈<span><br /></span>藍寶石<span>      </span>雷鳴<span><br /></span>黃玉<span>         <span class=\"GramE\"> <span><span>黯蝕</span></span></span><br /></span></p>",
